The Gallic Campaign Scenario
Difficulty : 5
Bonus : 50
--------------------------------------------------------------
To the North lie the land of the wild Celts, also known as Gauls.  Their benighted lands calls out for the civilizing presence of Rome.
But these Gauls are a stubborn people, whose backbones are stiffened by their leader Vercingetorix.  It will be your duty to remove this barbarian leader from this world by means fair or foul.
You will have five years in which to accomplish this goal.

